### Create user or register user

POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "sathish Arasu",
  "email": "sathsathish81485@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "confirmPassword": "password123"
}

### Get all users

GET http://localhost:3001/api/users


### Get one user

GET http://localhost:3001/api/users/1


### Update user

PUT http://localhost:3001/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Tamil Arasu Updated",
  "email": "tamil.updated@example.com"
}


### Delete user

DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/users/1


### Create habit

POST http://localhost:3001/api/habits
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

{
  "name": "Learn React",
  "description": "Study React for 2 hours"
}


### Get habits

GET http://localhost:3001/api/habits
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN


### Get one habit

GET http://localhost:3001/api/habits/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN


### Update habit

PUT http://localhost:3001/api/habits/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

{
  "name": "Learn React Advanced",
  "description": "Study advanced React concepts"
}


### Delete habit

DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/habits/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN
